# Start Work trigger

When the user message is **only** or primarily: `start work`, `start workagent`, `empieza`, `arranca`, or `status operativo`:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/start-work/SKILL.md` immediately.
2. Run the operational checklist (bot → pool → last enroll) before asking what to do next.
3. Reply with the **Estado operativo** report format from that skill.
